# tools/stage2_terrain: regenerated by terrain_gen.py/build_test.py/
# verify_terrain.py on every run - not committed deliverables. Terrain2.json
# (round36, "地形もエディット対象に") is the current terrain profile
# exported for schedule-editor.html's own terrain-paint tool - handed to
# the user directly rather than committed, same as Schedule2.json (its own
# enemy-placement counterpart) never was.
tools/stage2_terrain/terrain_tables.inc.asm
tools/stage2_terrain/Terrain2.json
tools/stage2_terrain/frames*/
tools/stage2_terrain/frames_*.png

